{
  "$schema": "../schemas/art_palette.schema.json",
  "kind": "art_palette",
  "_note": "Colour ramps, dark → light, mostly Kin-flavoured (§15.1). A descriptor picks one ramp and one accent; every part references slots into them. ~15 ramps across a 120-unit roster is what keeps mixed-source art from reading as a jumble.",
